  "bodyHash": "9a7c7125f60d421a",
  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#f0f\">MOA DECOR: 節日</span></h3>\n<p><em>這是一個裝飾模組，旨在為您的建築添加新的節日主題物品。目前已經有幾個模組添加了傢俱，本模組旨在成為它們的補充，因為您可以找到數百種不同的物品和元素來裝飾您的世界。作為<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>MOA DECOR</em>&nbsp;目錄中的又一個模組。</em></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/184/moa-festivo12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"749\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f0f\">合成</span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/172/c-festivo-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"228\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\">模組中的所有物品都可以在生存模式中获得。為了開始製作這些物品，您必須在合成桌上放置<strong>品紅色</strong>染料和綠寶石，這樣您將獲得<strong>9個節日寶石</strong>，通過將它們與其他材料組合，您將能夠獲得裝飾物品。<strong>共有150種不同的物品！</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/173/c-festivo-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"227\"></p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong>如果您想獲得女巫騎掃帚的模型，其合成必須使用一個節日寶石，加上該物品的額外材料，在本例中為坩堝、綠寶石、棍子和麥子。有些次要的合成是由兩個模型的物品組合衍生而來。在這些情況下，不需要寶石，因為它在之前的合成中已經需要了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/174/moa-festivo1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"452\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/175/moa-festivo2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"451\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/176/moa-festivo3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"569\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/177/moa-festivo4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"465\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/178/moa-festivo5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"428\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/179/moa-festivo6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"505\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/180/moa-festivo7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"554\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/181/moa-festivo8.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/183/moa-festivo11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1466\" height=\"765\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/185/moa-festivo13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1005\" height=\"867\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/182/moa-festivo10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1291\" height=\"958\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/739/186/moa-festivo14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"835\" height=\"948\"></p>\n<h2><em><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><u>注意：</u></strong></span>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">為了獲得更完整的體驗，建議查看<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MOA DECOR</strong>&nbsp;<strong>目錄</strong></span>中的其他模組，那裡有更多類別可以補充這個模組。</span></em></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
